  "clinical_uncertainties": [],
  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, it's a bit... it's embarrassing, really. It hurts when we try to be intimate. Me and my husband. And I...",
      "start_timestamp": "00:59",
      "end_timestamp": "01:10",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's, well... at the start mostly. Sort of a burning, and then sore afterwards. I don't...",
      "start_timestamp": "01:41",
      "end_timestamp": "01:49",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "It's been about six months now, doctor. She mentioned it to me around the time of the cold weather starting.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:12",
      "end_timestamp": "02:21",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "There's a dryness. I hadn't really thought it was connected, but it's there most of the time, even when we're not...",
      "start_timestamp": "02:39",
      "end_timestamp": "02:48",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Only my blood pressure. High blood pressure, I've had it for years and years.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:20",
      "end_timestamp": "03:27",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "She takes the little tablet every morning, amlodipine. Five milligrams, I give it to her with her tea.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:27",
      "end_timestamp": "03:37",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I had a hysterectomy. About twelve years ago, it must be. They said it was fibroids.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:03",
      "end_timestamp": "04:11",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.surgical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I live with my husband, but he isn't very steady on his feet now, so Dilys comes in to help the two of us. Nobody else, apart from my daughter on Sundays.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:19",
      "end_timestamp": "04:33",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Just roll up the sleeve, please. Your blood pressure is 138 over 82.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:01",
      "end_timestamp": "05:07",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Pulse is 72 beats per minute and regular.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:13",
      "end_timestamp": "05:17",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Temperature is 36.7 degrees, and the oxygen level is 98 percent.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:18",
      "end_timestamp": "05:24",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "All perfectly fine. Your weight, from the scales in the corridor, was 64 kilograms, and breathing is 16 breaths a minute.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:29",
      "end_timestamp": "05:40",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[4]",
        "vital_signs[5]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you, Seun, that's all done and you can get dressed. The skin around the opening is thin and pale, and it looks dry, with a little redness but no sores or lumps.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:06",
      "end_timestamp": "06:21",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I don't see anything that worries me. Honestly, what you describe, together with the dryness and given your age, most likely points to thinning and dryness of the tissues from lack of oestrogen.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:32",
      "end_timestamp": "06:48",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "We'll talk through gentle options at the next step. First I'd like a urine sample today, to rule out a water infection that could add to the burning. The nurse outside will give you a pot.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:16",
      "end_timestamp": "07:34",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. In the meantime, go slowly, take your time and stop if it hurts, there's no pressure to try at all.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:41",
      "end_timestamp": "07:52",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "If it hasn't eased within a month, come back and see me and we'll go through the choices properly.",
      "start_timestamp": "08:11",
      "end_timestamp": "08:20",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]",
